OL,3,GNEWSATwo Ryanair planes searched after
OL,4,Alanding in Rome as suspected bomb
OL,5,Athreats hit series of flights
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Ryanair planes have been searched
OL,8,Fafter landing in Rome after suspected
OL,9,Fbomb threats hit a series of flights in
OL,10,FEurope
OL,12,FOne of the planes - a flight from
OL,13,FDublin - was escorted by the Italian
OL,14,FAir Force until landing, writes our
OL,15,FEurope reporter
OL,17,FEarlier, four other flights landed at
OL,18,FEuropean airports after also being
OL,19,Ftargeted by suspected bomb threats
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
