OL,3,GNEWSATwo Ryanair planes searched after
OL,4,Alanding in Rome as suspected bomb
OL,5,Athreats hit series of flights
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo of the flights were inspected in
OL,8,FWarsaw, including one that had set off
OL,9,Ffrom London Heathrow
OL,11,FAnother plane that departed Manchester
OL,12,Fwas inspected in Murcia, Spain, where a
OL,13,Flocal official said no explosives were
OL,14,Ffound on the plane
OL,16,FOn Monday, a flight from London Luton
OL,17,Fto Sofia made an emergency landing in
OL,18,FBudapest, following a bomb threat
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
